    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Unlocking Zero-Shot Geospatial Reasoning via Indirect Rewards
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Xu%2C+C">Chenhui Xu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yu%2C+F">Fuxun Yu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Bianco%2C+M+J">Michael J. Bianco</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kovarskiy%2C+J">Jacob Kovarskiy</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Tang%2C+R">Raphael Tang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+Q">Qi Zhang</a>, 
      
